Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.56,0:02:10.06,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\fscx100\fscy100\c&HF7F9F3&\pos(358,398)}The Big Digimon Reunion!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.28,0:02:17.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.19,0:02:18.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Star Shower!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.32,0:02:21.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rosetta, score!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.28,0:02:25.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spike and Spike!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.48,0:02:28.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we rule! Yeah, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.20,0:02:30.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take that, Trollspires!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.94,0:02:32.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two, four, six, eight...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.82,0:02:34.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who do we appreciate? Us!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.10,0:02:41.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never thought I'd have\Nfriends like this more, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.78,0:02:43.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me, tell them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.50,0:02:45.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what if they don't\Nwant to come to my party?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.36,0:02:46.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course they will.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.46,0:02:50.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken, get over here and join us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.68,0:02:52.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what you got there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.50,0:02:53.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.42,0:02:54.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, come on, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.70,0:02:56.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This Christmas party was a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.16,0:02:57.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should forget the whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.38,0:02:58.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what am I going to\Ndo with all that eggnog?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.90,0:03:01.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys, Ken's got\Nsomething to show everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.72,0:03:02.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot, Davis.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.50,0:03:04.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great. No pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.08,0:03:06.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, guys, gather round.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.50,0:03:09.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it? Cool. Really? Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.16,0:03:17.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I request the honor of your\Npresence at a holiday celebration.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.52,0:03:19.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is, I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.56,0:03:20.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say no more!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.66,0:03:22.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're having a Christmas party!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.08,0:03:23.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're in! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.12,0:03:25.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Ken!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.82,0:03:27.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can we come?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.78,0:03:28.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.30,0:03:32.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe you'll even catch\NGatomon under the mistletoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.48,0:03:40.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it looks like cody\Nstill hates me well here
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.80,0:03:43.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it goes it looks like\Nken still hates me well
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.36,0:03:48.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,here he comes here you\Ngo cody you're invited
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.52,0:03:54.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,too really i'm glad that i made your list
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.70,0:03:59.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Attention, holiday shoppers. Get into the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.02,0:04:04.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,spirit of the season and spend spend spend
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.20,0:04:12.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sorry i'm so late guys but there was this\Nreally cute girl who wanted my autograph
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.18,0:04:16.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,oh that's a lame excuse zip it anybody
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.66,0:04:21.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ever hear a rehearsal sorry huh sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.60,0:04:24.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dad i'm going to be working late tonight\Nyou'll have to pick your own dinner sport
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.92,0:04:30.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's okay dad don't worry about it my\Nband's got a kick tonight anyway besides
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.86,0:04:34.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're a lousy cook very funny that's\Nnot what you said when you wolf down my
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.50,0:04:38.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,tuna surprise well the surprises on you\Ndad I fed it to the dog see ya don't work
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.96,0:04:45.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,too late I just love the holidays mummy\Nmom all those smiling faces all the better
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.50,0:04:48.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when we give them something to frown about\Nthanks for meeting me at the mall mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.68,0:04:51.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Monomi it's so nice of you\Nto return TK's homework he's
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.18,0:04:53.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so forgetful at At least\Nyour son does his homework.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.74,0:04:55.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had some Christmas\Nshopping to do anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.54,0:04:56.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm buying Davis a notebook.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.88,0:04:58.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not that he'll ever use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.08,0:05:00.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, thanks for\Nalways letting TK come over.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.40,0:05:02.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It really helps me out since I'm so busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.14,0:05:03.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.46,0:05:04.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK's a great kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.80,0:05:05.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, see ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.32,0:05:07.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.64,0:05:09.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't forget to save the notebook receipt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.38,0:05:11.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha, so he can exchange\Nit for a soccer ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.80,0:05:12.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.60,0:05:16.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, Mr. Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.26,0:05:19.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a pleasant surprise\Nbumping into you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.20,0:05:20.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you remember me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.58,0:05:22.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Oikawa, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.04,0:05:23.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.26,0:05:26.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.38,0:05:30.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You investigated the Highton View\NTerrace incident eight years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.40,0:05:32.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so nice to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.78,0:05:33.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.34,0:05:37.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, remember\Nthe Odaiba fog incident?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.10,0:05:41.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm afraid this current\Nmonster problem is related.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.74,0:05:44.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, it's only just\Nthe beginning. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.24,0:05:48.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that,\Nonly just the beginning?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.58,0:05:49.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.58,0:05:54.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the meantime, you should be careful\Nof who you let your sons play with.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.58,0:05:55.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My sons?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.38,0:05:58.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you know about TK and Matt?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.52,0:06:02.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, I know everything, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.82,0:06:04.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enjoy the holidays.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.76,0:06:07.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the most wonderful time of the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.96,0:06:10.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.30,0:06:14.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if the boys got\Nthemselves mixed up in now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.70,0:06:16.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought all that digital\Nworld stuff was over with.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.96,0:06:19.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now the danger starts all over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.74,0:06:24.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's me, Agumon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.46,0:06:25.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.32,0:06:27.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's Christmas?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.50,0:06:30.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It means you're going to be the best\Npresent the original Digi Dustin ever got.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.98,0:06:32.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.22,0:06:34.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi's in America.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.14,0:06:36.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Palmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.54,0:06:40.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We wouldn't let everybody join up\Nwith their partners and leave you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.02,0:06:43.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I can't wait to see Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.42,0:06:44.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This will be a snap.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.62,0:06:46.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll open up a portal from\Nthe digital world that'll
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.62,0:06:49.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,drop Palmon off right in\Nthe middle of downtown U .S.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.34,0:06:50.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of A.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.25,0:06:52.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say hi to Mimi for me,\Nand when you come back,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.08,0:06:55.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,see if she'll let me borrow\Nthat pink blouse I love so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.22,0:06:57.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.56,0:06:59.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's... this? Don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.82,0:07:01.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, first sight, what a...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:03.73,0:07:07.03,jogress,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,400)\c&HFAF3E6&\pos(320,237)}24/12/2002 1AM
Dialogue: 1,0:07:03.73,0:07:07.03,jogress,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,400)\c&HFAF3E6&\pos(330,392)}Mimi's house, USA
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.94,0:07:07.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi's gonna be so\Nsurprised when she wakes up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.34,0:07:13.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mrs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.25,0:07:15.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ichijouji, you can go\Nhome now. Quitting time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.20,0:07:17.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, already?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.60,0:07:18.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel like I just started.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.00,0:07:20.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go home to that son of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.60,0:07:22.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He sure has changed recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.34,0:07:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I called the other day, and we just\Nhad the most lovely conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.36,0:07:27.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He never would have\Nbothered himself with such
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.14,0:07:29.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,trivialities as answering\Nthe phone before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.26,0:07:30.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What brought on the pleasant change?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.84,0:07:33.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I guess it's just the holiday spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.58,0:07:34.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.30,0:07:36.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me out of here, Davis.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.74,0:07:39.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I'm supposed to be a present,\Nbut did you have the gift wrapping?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.16,0:07:39.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.07,0:07:41.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll ruin the surprise, Agumon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.82,0:07:43.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait till I give you the signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.38,0:07:44.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.78,0:07:46.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.69,0:07:47.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.88,0:07:49.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, Agumon, no way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.46,0:07:51.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gabumon, good to see you, Izzy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.32,0:07:52.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gabumon, don't squeeze so hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.82,0:07:53.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get a cramp.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.40,0:07:56.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think they like their present.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.58,0:07:58.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just call me Davis Claus.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.58,0:07:59.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just what I wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.68,0:08:00.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How'd you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.59,0:08:01.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A little Betamon told us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.78,0:08:02.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.92,0:08:05.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Christmas is a time for\Nfamilies to get together.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.48,0:08:07.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, this is so exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.62,0:08:10.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People are already lining\Nup for Matt's concert.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.36,0:08:11.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Sora.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.66,0:08:13.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be sure to get good seats.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.68,0:08:15.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Especially once you give\Nhim these homemade cookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.56,0:08:16.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.40,0:08:20.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora, wait up. Oh, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.98,0:08:24.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something smells good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.82,0:08:28.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt's busy getting ready,\Nbut I'll take those to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.62,0:08:30.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet you will. No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.48,0:08:32.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll eat the whole thing yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.24,0:08:34.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, I resent that. I'm on a diet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.50,0:08:37.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, um, Sora, are you going\Nto the concert with anybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.46,0:08:39.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, not that it matters to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.30,0:08:40.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just wondering.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.72,0:08:44.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I want to be available in\Ncase Matt is free afterwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.62,0:08:47.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see. Matt, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.42,0:08:51.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.72,0:08:53.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not mad at me, Tai?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.38,0:08:54.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.82,0:08:56.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now get in there and\Nsay hi to Matt for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.04,0:08:57.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.98,0:09:00.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The least you can do is\Nleave us the cookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.16,0:09:05.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell you what, I'll make\Nsome special ones for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.74,0:09:08.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be waiting. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.30,0:09:10.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what, Tai?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.16,0:09:11.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.38,0:09:13.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've really grown up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.80,0:09:17.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look out! I'm coming! Huh? Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.46,0:09:20.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch where you're going, June!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.16,0:09:20.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.07,0:09:22.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in a hurry to see Matt!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.76,0:09:24.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the girls are the cutest!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.20,0:09:27.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And this is my room. Nothing fancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.64,0:09:29.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.68,0:09:31.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a good picture of you, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.76,0:09:33.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, it's not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.50,0:09:35.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my older brother, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.14,0:09:35.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.58,0:09:37.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.22,0:09:41.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you ready to rock?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.72,0:09:44.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't hear you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.48,0:10:00.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a really good singer!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.46,0:10:03.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though I may be biased.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.40,0:10:04.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.82,0:10:06.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm your number one man! Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.30,0:10:14.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love a good concert
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.40,0:10:21.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mummymon, we're going to bring a new\Nmeaning to the phrase Monsters of Rock
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.34,0:11:01.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.02,0:11:03.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope this is part of the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.02,0:11:06.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You never know with rock concerts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.08,0:11:10.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a bunch of static coming through.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.10,0:11:12.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.44,0:11:14.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're on live!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.32,0:11:18.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.40,0:11:23.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do they do here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.44,0:11:25.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe they're just music lovers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.68,0:11:30.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a concert!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.56,0:11:31.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These crazy kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.18,0:11:35.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Woodstock, now that was a concert.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.54,0:11:40.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon! Digivolve! Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.34,0:11:44.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't, Tom! What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.64,0:11:45.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you forget how?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.80,0:11:46.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.71,0:11:47.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.78,0:11:52.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's another one!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.98,0:11:55.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready for the plan of action, Tai?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.06,0:11:57.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I have one!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.36,0:11:59.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.30,0:12:00.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A wildfire?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.02,0:12:04.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.54,0:12:06.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just say go fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.60,0:12:09.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll get the hang of it, Yoli.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.72,0:12:11.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't even learn go fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.02,0:12:18.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you see what I saw?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.90,0:12:19.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken just laughed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.32,0:12:21.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a great smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.94,0:12:24.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken, you should try to laugh more often.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.40,0:12:26.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.38,0:12:33.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's so nice to have a house full of laughing\Nchildren again oh dear i'm getting all
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.62,0:12:36.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,misty i promised myself i wouldn't cry a
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.82,0:12:40.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,quick thick sad thoughts\Noh the phone come now
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.54,0:12:43.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pull yourself together.\NHi, Ichijouji residence.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.00,0:12:46.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my deal what do you guys want to play how
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.64,0:12:49.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,about strip some boy\Nnamed ty's on the phone
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.64,0:12:52.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for your friend kari\Nsomething must be wrong
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.10,0:13:06.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you ruined my\Nconcert, man. Glad to see
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.18,0:13:09.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're focused there they\Nare come on davis can't
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.82,0:13:12.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we move any faster don't\Nbe a backseat driver
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.54,0:13:16.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ken a control spire no\Nwonder time needs us Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.66,0:13:19.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if it's help he needs,\Nit's help he'll get.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.66,0:13:20.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thunder Blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.36,0:13:23.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rock Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.60,0:13:30.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time for us to clean up this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.90,0:13:48.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon! Digimon!\NDigimon! Digimon! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.64,0:14:47.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.95,0:14:48.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dig old school style
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.86,0:14:49.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.77,0:14:50.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,tk let's turn the cameras\Non this is great stuff this
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.69,0:14:51.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,will be the highest rated\Nshow we've ever had we'll even
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.60,0:14:52.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,get a raise if anyone's
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.51,0:14:53.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,left to give
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.43,0:14:54.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it is it just me
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.34,0:14:55.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or isn't this exactly what\Nhappened four years ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.25,0:14:56.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't we meet a metal shop?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.74,0:14:59.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how long\Nthey can keep this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.80,0:15:02.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew Davis liked action, but this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.36,0:15:08.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're all over the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.88,0:15:10.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, they've got us outnumbered.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.32,0:15:11.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, I've got an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.96,0:15:15.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone, get all the evil\NDigimon together in one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.14,0:15:17.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna send them\Nback to the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.26,0:15:18.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.78,0:15:19.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pulse them on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.00,0:15:20.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At your service.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.58,0:15:22.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tempest wing!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.18,0:15:29.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready, Parker?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.56,0:15:30.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's turn one off.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.24,0:15:32.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Golden deuce!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.82,0:15:38.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is your laptop ready, Izzy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.56,0:15:39.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready and able.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.22,0:15:42.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then what are we waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.62,0:15:43.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digital Gate, open!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.96,0:15:45.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.94,0:15:55.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that wasn't so easy as pie.\NOh boy, we should make it a...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.96,0:15:58.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,rule that Tai and davis aren't\Nallowed to be together in the same
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.84,0:16:02.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,room forget about them carrie\Nit's the digimon that worry me
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.90,0:16:07.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,how'd they get here to our world\Nin the first place not to mention
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.08,0:16:09.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that control spire what if
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.06,0:16:11.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's a brand new
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.86,0:16:18.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enemy, listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.18,0:16:23.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,everyone i'm pretty sure i know\Nwho's behind all this it's got to
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.42,0:16:29.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be our Unimon you think so what\Nmakes you think she's involved
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.66,0:16:34.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because she's able to move\Nfreely between the two worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.98,0:16:35.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Birdramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.89,0:16:36.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Biyomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.81,0:16:37.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we're up to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.64,0:16:39.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Turn down the lights!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.86,0:16:40.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Push him back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.77,0:16:41.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Push him back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.69,0:16:42.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.46,0:16:44.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just two Ultimates left.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.24,0:16:47.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis, Ken, would you\Nlike to do the honors?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.64,0:16:49.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,New plan, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.40,0:16:52.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to fight Ultimates with Ultimates!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.82,0:16:56.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go back to your rookie stages\Nand get ready to DNA Digiball!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.96,0:16:58.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vimon! Digiball! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.60,0:17:01.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next, Vimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.68,0:17:07.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hawkmon, Digivolve to Aquilamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.28,0:17:15.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armadimon Digivolve to Aquilamon
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.40,0:17:24.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Patamon Digivolve to Aquilamon
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.22,0:17:29.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now let's see what all this DNA\Nfuss is about. Show him guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.04,0:17:34.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,X-B-Mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.90,0:17:38.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stingmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.18,0:17:42.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,D-A-D-Digital 2!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.96,0:17:46.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I-A-Ultra-Mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.82,0:17:48.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,X-B-Mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.30,0:17:50.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,D-A-Ultra-Mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.80,0:17:53.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aquilamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.20,0:17:55.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,X-B-Mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.28,0:18:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,DNA Digivolve to!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.08,0:18:02.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zudomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.46,0:18:04.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ankylomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.88,0:18:08.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.28,0:18:12.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,DNA Digivolve to!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.88,0:18:15.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shakkoumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.06,0:18:16.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sting Strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.28,0:18:28.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pachinobomb!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.18,0:18:43.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And to all, a good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.12,0:18:45.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.58,0:18:47.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the Digidestined together.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.40,0:18:48.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Ultimate Teamwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.08,0:18:55.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guys, if Aru Kunemon and her Digimon can\Nmove between worlds, then we're in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.50,0:18:57.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What'll we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.52,0:19:00.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll have to fight\Nall over again. Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.06,0:19:02.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.56,0:19:04.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.58,0:19:06.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll get her for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.20,0:19:10.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for walking me\Nto the train, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.58,0:19:12.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess my party is over. Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.56,0:19:15.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was short, but it was fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.76,0:19:19.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We had a great time, Ken. Me too. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.52,0:19:22.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we're all gonna come over next year.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.08,0:19:25.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.62,0:19:27.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And a Happy New Year.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.76,0:19:29.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.90,0:19:30.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.86,0:19:33.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I forgot to kiss T.K. under the mistletoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.90,0:19:35.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He never quits.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.54,0:19:36.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis, take
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.00,0:19:45.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.91,0:19:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll never learn about women.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.83,0:19:49.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon, you are the best present ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.28,0:19:50.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.22,0:19:51.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you stay through till New Year's?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.02,0:19:54.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you'd never ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.78,0:19:56.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be careful, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.18,0:19:57.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.09,0:20:00.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want you losing your\NChristmas dinner on my bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.98,0:20:04.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me a Christmas bedtime\Nstory. What's your time?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.86,0:20:06.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.76,0:20:08.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Twas a Digimon Christmas\Nand everyone was busy,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.98,0:20:10.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,especially the likes of Tentomon and Izzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.90,0:20:14.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe played with Gomamon, Matt\Nand Gabumon ate, Palmon saw Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.08,0:20:15.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that great?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.08,0:20:19.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cody and Upamon shared a little sushi\Nwhile Perurumon sat on Yoli's tushy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.18,0:20:21.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tokomon went caroling.\NKen's thankful for friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.72,0:20:24.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,while in Davis' dreams,\Nthe fun never ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.42,0:20:25.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good night now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.33,0:20:26.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.90,0:20:32.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We now bring you the\Nspecial report. Why, what's
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.60,0:20:36.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,going on we've received\Nmany eyewitness reports on
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.28,0:20:38.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yesterday's monster\Nattack downtown including
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.84,0:20:41.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sightings of mysterious\Nblack obelisks international
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.72,0:20:44.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,reports now confirm these\Ntowers are appearing
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.20,0:20:48.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All over the world. It's\Njust like the one at Matt's.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.60,0:20:52.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,concert more control\Nspires ah what's the matter
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.92,0:20:55.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Izzy did your computer\Nfreeze again it's even
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.70,0:20:59.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,worse. Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.92,0:21:01.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digiports are opening all over the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.92,0:21:02.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.24,0:21:05.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there's nothing we can do to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.70,0:21:08.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't suppose it could be\NSanta's new way of delivering toys.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.44,0:21:10.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now what are we What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:25.22,0:21:31.54,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Asu e mukau kisha wa togireta reeru de
Dialogue: 1,0:21:31.54,0:21:37.73,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Mou furikaeru bakari tomadou watashi
Dialogue: 1,0:21:39.15,0:21:45.54,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Te to te tsunagi awase issho ni hashiru to
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.66,0:21:44.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we're together, we're\Ngoing together with each other.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:45.54,0:21:52.75,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sou ookina chikara ga daseru no wa naze?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:56.29,0:22:03.34,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo itsu demo tsuuji atteru kara
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.66,0:22:05.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like it. I like it.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:03.34,0:22:09.61,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo doko demo tonde ikeru wa
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.40,0:22:07.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't lose it.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.34,0:22:17.23,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo itsu demo minna ga soba ni iru
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.74,0:22:16.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every time, every time, every\Ntime, everyone is at the same time.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.23,0:22:24.44,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Kitto kitto dare demo hitori janai wa
